WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.400
The reason that I asked Dr. Fauci what color his tie was and what day of the week it was and

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:11.200
what color the carpet is. What color is the carpet in front of you? He looked by the way.

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:13.920
I thought he was going to answer that one. He looked very carefully at the carpet.

00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:22.240
The reason I asked those questions was precisely to test the good faith nature of his invocation

00:00:22.240 --> 00:00:27.200
at the Fifth Amendment. I think it's pretty clear given Dr. Fauci's 111 invocations of the

00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:31.920
Fifth Amendment included questions that he had could have no fear of prosecution on. It's

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:38.720
going to get prosecuted for the color of his tie. It shows that he had no interest and no

00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:42.560
intention of answering any of our questions and that is an abuse of the pro that there's no privilege

00:00:42.560 --> 00:00:50.480
for any of that.

